 (text "1 VTREF (sense only)     2 EN/RESET (programmer open drain)     3 GND\n4 BOARD RX <- programmer TX      5 BOARD TX -> programmer RX      6 GPIO0/BOOT\nOnly 3.3 V UART levels. No power injection at VTREF. Cable pin n maps to IDC pin n.\nPin-1 triangle and no-paste contact pads are mandatory. Cable/clip access is a placement gate.\nBoot: ground GPIO0; hold actual EN low >=50us; release EN; keep GPIO0 low >=3ms after actual EN is high and until ROM download starts. RVB21 supervisor holds EN low 12-28ms after rail recovery.\nJ202/J203: Wurth61300211121. Adapter continuity and mechanical access remain OPEN." (at 22.86 147.32 0)
 (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)
)
